cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If scitech-librarian helped your literature search, please cite it."
title: "scitech-librarian: a reproducible literature-search instrument with research directories and PRISMA reports"
type: software
version: "3.2.9"
date-released: "2026-08-31"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabiocampolim-design/scitech-librarian"
authors:
  - family-names: Campolim
    given-names: Fabio
keywords:
  - literature search
  - systematic review
  - PRISMA
  - bibliographic databases
  - OpenAlex
  - NASA ADS
  - Scopus
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Standard-library Python tool that renders one structured query into the
  native syntax of eight bibliographic databases, archives every run with the
  exact query strings and hit counts, accumulates runs and externally
  obtained records in a research directory with provenance, tracks journal
  metrics per year, and writes literature-search reports with a PRISMA 2020
  flow diagram and PRISMA-S checklist.
